      "source": "# @knowledge 控制流演示\n\n下面的函数可以在 `pure` 模式显式运行并产生真实 Trace。示例把 ASCII 数字和换行写入标准输出资源。\n\n# @exec 演示\n\n## @exec main\n\n`x = 0`\n\n`buffer = memory.new(1, 1)`\n\n`buffer[1] = 10`\n\n`stdout = resource.open(\"stdio\", \"stdout\", [\"write\"])`\n\n**while x < 3**\n\n**if x > 1**\n\n`buffer[0] = 48 + x`\n\n**else**\n\n`buffer[0] = 48`\n\n**end**\n\n`resource.write(stdout, buffer, 0, 2)`\n\n**x = x + 1**\n\n**end**\n\n`resource.close(stdout)`\n\n`return 3`\n",
